flowchart TB
  engineer[Engineer or protected GitHub environment]
  offline[Offline CI\nBicep build · tests · static checks]
  oidc[Short-lived OIDC token\noptional authenticated path]

  engineer --> offline
  engineer -. explicit approval .-> oidc

  subgraph subscription[Personally owned Azure subscription]
    deployment[Subscription-scope Bicep deployment]
    budget[Monthly subscription budget\nactual 80% · forecast 100%]

    subgraph policy[Policy baseline]
      initiative[Custom initiative]
      tags[Required RG tags\nAudit by default]
      locations[Allowed locations\nAudit by default]
      inherit[Inherit missing resource tags\nDisabled by default]
      assignment[Subscription assignment\nidentity only with Modify]
      role[Tag Contributor\nonly with Modify]
      remediation[Bounded remediation tasks\ndisabled by default]

      initiative --> tags
      initiative --> locations
      initiative --> inherit
      assignment --> initiative
      assignment --> role
      role --> remediation
      remediation --> inherit
    end

    subgraph governanceRg[Governance resource group]
      actionGroup[Azure Monitor action group\nno receiver in committed example]
      reader[Optional Entra group Reader\nresource-group scope only]
      lock[CanNotDelete lock]
    end

    deployment --> budget
    deployment --> assignment
    deployment --> actionGroup
    deployment --> reader
    deployment --> lock
    budget --> actionGroup
  end

  oidc -. validate · what-if · deploy .-> deployment
